8,"ACHIKADIDI | Council on the Arts, North Dakota",https://www.arts.nd.gov/achikadidi,Kalendo is a track and music video from the enhanced CD Achikadidi: Traditional Ma'di Music of Southern Sudan and Northern Uganda produced by the North Dakota Council on the Arts in 2003. The song was a favorite of Ma'di militiamen who fought in the 1980s in Sudan's civil war. It describes the weariness of war and the desire to return to a life of farming. Watch the YouTube video via ...,"Ma’di, Southern",Nilo-Saharan
